<SettingsInfoBlock type="Float" default_value="0.1" changeable_without_restart="No" />Soft limit for number of active connection distributed cache will try to keep free. After the number of free connections goes below distributed_cache_keep_up_free_connections_ratio * max_connections, connections with oldest activity will be closed until the number goes above the limit.

## distributed_cache_write_pool_size {#distributed_cache_write_pool_size}

