Number of rows not written to the metric families tables of TimeSeries tables because the deduplication cache already had them or the same insert had already written them.

### TimeSeriesMetricFamiliesDeduplicationCacheMisses {#timeseriesmetricfamiliesdeduplicationcachemisses}

Number of rows written to the metric families tables of TimeSeries tables after they were not found in the deduplication cache.

### TimeSeriesTagsDeduplicationCacheHits {#timeseriestagsdeduplicationcachehits}

Number of rows not written to the tags tables of TimeSeries tables because the deduplication cache already had them or the same insert had already written them.

