Number of vectors added to usearch indexes.

### USearchAddVisitedMembers {#usearchaddvisitedmembers}

Number of nodes visited when adding vectors to usearch indexes.

### USearchSearchComputedDistances {#usearchsearchcomputeddistances}

Number of times distance was computed when searching usearch indexes.

### USearchSearchCount {#usearchsearchcount}

Number of search operations performed in usearch indexes.

### USearchSearchVisitedMembers {#usearchsearchvisitedmembers}

Number of nodes visited when searching in usearch indexes.

