Bytes passed through 'max_network_bandwidth_for_user' throttler.

### UserThrottlerSleepMicroseconds {#userthrottlersleepmicroseconds}

Total time a query was sleeping to conform 'max_network_bandwidth_for_user' throttling.

### UserTimeMicroseconds {#usertimemicroseconds}

Total time spent in processing (queries and other tasks) threads executing CPU instructions in user mode. This includes time CPU pipeline was stalled due to main memory access, cache misses, branch mispredictions, hyper-threading, etc.

### VectorSimilarityIndexCacheHits {#vectorsimilarityindexcachehits}

Number of times an index granule has been found in the vector index cache.

### VectorSimilarityIndexCacheMisses {#vectorsimilarityindexcachemisses}

Number of times an index granule has not been found in the vector index cache and had to be read from disk.

### VectorSimilarityIndexCacheWeightLost {#vectorsimilarityindexcacheweightlost}

Approximate number of bytes evicted from the vector index cache.

